msgid ":mod:`!tkinter.dnd` --- Drag and drop support"
msgstr ":mod:`!tkinter.dnd` --- Dukungan drag and drop"

msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/tkinter/dnd.py`"
msgstr "**Kode sumber:** :source:`Lib/tkinter/dnd.py`"

msgid ""
"This is experimental and due to be deprecated when it is replaced with the "
"Tk DND."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini bersifat eksperimental dan akan dinyatakan sudah tidak disarankan "
"lagi ketika digantikan dengan Tk DND."

msgid ""
"The :mod:`!tkinter.dnd` module provides drag-and-drop support for objects "
"within a single application, within the same window or between windows. To "
"enable an object to be dragged, you must create an event binding for it that "
"starts the drag-and-drop process. Typically, you bind a ButtonPress event to "
"a callback function that you write (see :ref:`Bindings-and-Events`). The "
"function should call :func:`dnd_start`, where *source* is the object to be "
"dragged, and *event* is the event that invoked the call (the argument to "
"your callback function)."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`!tkinter.dnd` menyediakan dukungan drag-and-drop untuk objek "
"dalam satu aplikasi, dalam jendela yang sama atau antar jendela. Untuk "
"memungkinkan sebuah objek diseret, Anda harus membuat event binding untuk "
"objek tersebut yang memulai proses drag-and-drop. Biasanya, Anda mengikat "
"event ButtonPress ke fungsi callback yang Anda tulis (lihat :ref:`Bindings-"
"and-Events`). Fungsi tersebut harus memanggil :func:`dnd_start`, dengan "
"*source* adalah objek yang akan diseret, dan *event* adalah event yang "
"memicu pemanggilan tersebut (argumen untuk fungsi callback Anda)."

msgid "Selection of a target object occurs as follows:"
msgstr "Pemilihan objek target terjadi sebagai berikut:"

msgid "Top-down search of the area under the mouse for a target widget:"
msgstr ""
"Pencarian dari atas ke bawah pada area di bawah mouse untuk widget target:"

msgid "the target widget should have a callable *dnd_accept* attribute;"
msgstr ""
"widget target harus memiliki atribut *dnd_accept* yang dapat dipanggil;"

msgid ""
"if *dnd_accept* is not present or returns ``None``, the search moves to the "
"parent widget;"
msgstr ""
"jika *dnd_accept* tidak ada atau mengembalikan ``None``, pencarian berpindah "
"ke widget induk;"

msgid "if no target widget is found, the target object is ``None``."
msgstr ""
"jika tidak ada widget target yang ditemukan, objek target adalah ``None``."

msgid "Call to ``<old_target>.dnd_leave(source, event)``."
msgstr "Pemanggilan ``<old_target>.dnd_leave(source, event)``."

msgid "Call to ``<new_target>.dnd_enter(source, event)``."
msgstr "Pemanggilan ``<new_target>.dnd_enter(source, event)``."

msgid "Call to ``<target>.dnd_commit(source, event)`` to notify of the drop."
msgstr ""
"Pemanggilan ``<target>.dnd_commit(source, event)`` untuk memberitahukan "
"terjadinya drop."

msgid ""
"Call to ``<source>.dnd_end(target, event)`` to signal the end of drag-and-"
"drop."
msgstr ""
"Pemanggilan ``<source>.dnd_end(target, event)`` untuk menandakan berakhirnya "
"drag-and-drop."

msgid ""
"The *DndHandler* class handles drag-and-drop events tracking Motion and "
"ButtonRelease events on the root of the event widget."
msgstr ""
"Kelas *DndHandler* menangani event drag-and-drop dengan melacak event Motion "
"dan ButtonRelease pada root widget event."

msgid "Cancel the drag-and-drop process."
msgstr "Membatalkan proses drag-and-drop."

msgid "Execute end of drag-and-drop functions."
msgstr "Menjalankan fungsi akhir drag-and-drop."

msgid "Inspect area below mouse for target objects while a drag is performed."
msgstr "Memeriksa area di bawah mouse untuk objek target saat drag dilakukan."

msgid "Signal end of drag when the release pattern is triggered."
msgstr "Menandakan akhir drag ketika pola pelepasan dipicu."

msgid ""
"Factory function for the drag-and-drop process. Return "
"the :class:`DndHandler` instance managing the drag, or ``None`` if a drag "
"could not be started."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi factory untuk proses drag-and-drop. Mengembalikan "
"instance :class:`DndHandler` yang mengelola drag, atau ``None`` jika drag "
"tidak dapat dimulai."

msgid ":ref:`Bindings-and-Events`"
msgstr ":ref:`Bindings-and-Events`"
